# Isolated reviewer worktrees — full copies of this repo inside it.
#
# BELT AND BRACES, NOT LOAD-BEARING, and the distinction is the point. Prettier 3
# already honours .gitignore, which has carried `.claude/worktrees/` since
# 2026-08-05, so prettier was NEVER walking these — only eslint was, because
# eslint does not read .gitignore. An earlier version of this comment claimed
# prettier "passes today only because those copies happen to be conformant".
# That was an inference stated as a measurement; removing this line and planting
# a malformed file in a live worktree leaves format:check clean.
#
# Kept anyway: it decouples prettier from future .gitignore edits, and someone
# pruning that file would be thinking about git, not about formatting.
#
# NOT the whole of `.claude/`: settings.json, the agent briefs and the skills are
# tracked and were being checked. Ignoring the parent hid them. componentLibrary-o0n.
